function report=studyRocketInnerGraphKrylov(folder,sourceCase)
%STUDYROCKETINNERGRAPHKRYLOV 在最新同Q剩余上区分一次扫描、B求逆及时间正则作用。
% 模块一：完整缓存重算最新保存方向的作用，不把旧FD像当当前精确模型。
% 模块二：同一B与tau，仅比较一次扫描和有界内部B求解，不重复时间尺度扫描。
% 模块三：用当前完整A=-J及原粗像评价方向，只作模型预测，不提交新流场。
root=fileparts(fileparts(mfilename('fullpath')));addpath(root,fullfile(root,'internalFlow'));setupCutCellFlow;
assert(~exist(folder,'dir'),'InnerGraphStudy:Overwrite','不得覆盖真实内部图研究。');mkdir(folder);
assert(~isempty(regexp(sourceCase,'^krylov[0-9]+$','once')));
sourceFile=fullfile(root,'outputs','v83_validation',sourceCase,'wall_velocity_krylov_evidence.mat');
s=load(sourceFile,'result','gas','boundary');r=s.result;gas=s.gas;boundary=s.boundary;Q=r.Q;scale=r.residualScale;rhs=r.initialRate./scale;
assert(r.acceptedNonlinearIterations==0&&isequaln(Q,r.initialQ)&&isfield(r.firstOperator,'wlsNormalFactor'));
operator=r.firstOperator;direction=r.linearLog{end}.steadyDirectionEvidence.directionU;savedNSValue=r.linearLog{end}.steadyDirectionEvidence.value;
coarseFile=r.options.coarseOperatorFile;mixedColumns=r.options.coarseMixedColumns;localColumns=r.options.coarseLocalColumns;
baseInfo=struct;for key={'primitive','gradient','viscousFaceFlux'},baseInfo.(key{1})=r.initialInfo.(key{1});end;clear r s;
t=load(coarseFile,'coarse');space=t.coarse.space;primitiveSpace=t.coarse.mixedLift.primitiveSpace;primitiveSpace.geometry=space.geometry;cut=space.geometry;clear t;
cache=buildCutCellSelectedDirectionCache(Q,baseInfo,cut,gas,boundary,scale);clear baseInfo;
initialModel=applyCutCellSelectedDirection(cache,direction);remaining=rhs+initialModel;
initialModelNSDifference=norm(initialModel-savedNSValue,'fro')/max(1,norm(savedNSValue,'fro'));assert(initialModelNSDifference<2e-6);
[coarse,reuseReport]=loadRocketLocalCoarseOperator(coarseFile,cache,space,primitiveSpace,mixedColumns,localColumns,256*1024^2);clear primitiveSpace space;
options=struct('maximumIterations',32,'relativeTolerance',1e-3,'maximumBasisBytes',1024*1024^2,'saveBasisEvidence',false);
[single,singleReport]=solveRocketWlsNormalPreconditioner(operator,remaining);
[inner,innerReport]=solveRocketInnerGraphKrylov(operator,remaining,options);candidates={single,inner};names={'singleScan','inner32'};evidence=cell(2,1);summaries=cell(2,1);
for j=1:2
    value=candidates{j};Bvalue=applyRocketWlsNormalOperator(operator,value);Avalue=-applyCutCellSelectedDirection(cache,value);
    coarseRight=remaining-Avalue;weights=coarse.upper\(coarse.upper'\(coarse.image'*coarseRight(:)));
    [correction,coarseReport]=solveRocketLocalCoarseSystem(coarse,coarseRight);total=value+correction;
    totalAction=-applyCutCellSelectedDirection(cache,total);predicted=Avalue+reshape(coarse.image*weights,size(Q));
    linearity=norm(totalAction-predicted,'fro')/max(1,norm(totalAction,'fro'));assert(linearity<1e-9,'InnerGraphStudy:Coarse','粗像叠加未复现当前完整模型。');
    alpha=dot(remaining(:),totalAction(:))/dot(totalAction(:),totalAction(:));best=remaining-alpha*totalAction;assert(norm(best,'fro')<=norm(remaining,'fro')*(1+1e-10));
    temporal=value/operator.pseudoTimeStepSeconds;graphA=Bvalue-temporal;
    summary=struct('name',names{j},'relativeBResidual',norm(remaining-Bvalue,'fro')/norm(remaining,'fro'), ...
        'fullADirectionRelativeResidual',norm(remaining-Avalue,'fro')/norm(remaining,'fro'), ...
        'afterCoarseRelativeResidual',norm(remaining-totalAction,'fro')/norm(remaining,'fro'), ...
        'bestScalarAfterCoarse',alpha,'predictedTotalDefectAfterBestScalar',norm(best,'fro')/norm(rhs,'fro'), ...
        'remainingSquaredNormRemovedByBestScalar',1-norm(best,'fro')^2/norm(remaining,'fro')^2, ...
        'temporalActionNormRelativeToRemaining',norm(temporal,'fro')/norm(remaining,'fro'), ...
        'temporalProjectionOnRemaining',dot(remaining(:),temporal(:))/dot(remaining(:),remaining(:)), ...
        'graphAToFullAActionRelativeDifference',norm(graphA-Avalue,'fro')/max(1,norm(Avalue,'fro')), ...
        'coarseCurrentActionLinearityDifference',linearity,'fixedOuterLinearMapClaimed',j==1,'originalNSAcceptanceClaimed',false);
    evidence{j}=struct('name',names{j},'value',value,'Bvalue',Bvalue,'Avalue',Avalue,'coarseWeights',weights, ...
        'correction',correction,'total',total,'totalAction',totalAction,'coarseReport',coarseReport,'summary',summary);summaries{j}=summary;
    fprintf('INNER_GRAPH %s B=%.9g Afull=%.9g afterCoarse=%.9g bestTotal=%.9g\n',names{j},summary.relativeBResidual, ...
        summary.fullADirectionRelativeResidual,summary.afterCoarseRelativeResidual,summary.predictedTotalDefectAfterBestScalar);
end
report=struct('status','tested-real-current-remaining-single-scan-versus-bounded-inner-B-inverse-model-diagnostic', ...
    'sourceCase',sourceCase,'cellCount',size(Q,1),'sourceFaces',operator.sourceFaces,'pseudoTimeStepSeconds',operator.pseudoTimeStepSeconds, ...
    'initialCurrentModelDefect',norm(remaining,'fro')/norm(rhs,'fro'),'currentModelToSavedNSDirectionDifference',initialModelNSDifference, ...
    'summaries',{summaries},'innerGraphBApplications',innerReport.totalBApplicationsIncludingScanDiagnostics, ...
    'additionalSingleScanDiagnosticBApplications',1,'additionalCandidateBApplications',2, ...
    'newSelectedJApplications',5,'coarseReuseProbeModelApplications',1,'newCoarseConstructionApplications',0, ...
    'newActualNSEvaluations',0,'newFlowAcceptances',0,'newPhysicalState',false,'physicalSolution',false, ...
    'newProductionSolvedAreaM2',0,'innerMethodRequiresFlexibleOuter',true,'engineProcessID',feature('getpid'));
save(fullfile(folder,'inner_graph_real_evidence.mat'),'report','sourceFile','coarseFile','Q','scale','rhs','direction','savedNSValue', ...
    'initialModel','remaining','options','singleReport','innerReport','evidence','reuseReport','-v7');
fid=fopen(fullfile(folder,'inner_graph_real_summary.json'),'w','n','UTF-8');assert(fid>=0);guard=onCleanup(@()fclose(fid));fprintf(fid,'%s',jsonencode(report));fprintf('%s\n',jsonencode(report));
end
